OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Tory leader Findlay says
OL,4,ASNP's indy 'obsession' is dangerously
OL,5,Airresponsible
OL,6,
OL,7,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,8,FFindlay has described the SNP's
OL,9,F"obsession" with independence as
OL,10,F"dangerously irresponsible".
OL,12,FFirst Minister John Swinney has said he
OL,13,Fwants to hold a second Scottish
OL,14,Findependence referendum by 2031,
OL,15,Fdespite successive prime ministers
OL,16,Frefusing to countenance another poll.
OL,18,FFindlay said that while the United
OL,19,FKingdom continues to face "grave
OL,20,Fthreats" from China, Russia and Iran, a
OL,21,Fdivided UK would be "a gift to our
OL,22,Fenemies".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
