OL,3,GNEWSAScottish Tory leader Findlay says
OL,4,ASNP's indy 'obsession' is dangerously
OL,5,Airresponsible
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd he called on Swinney to respect the
OL,8,Fresult of the 2014 referendum where a
OL,9,Fmajority of Scots voted no to
OL,10,Findependence.
